            "description": "The QuickStart variation creates a fully customizable VPC environment in a single region with a Red Hat OpenShift cluster. Designed for rapid deployment in development and demonstration scenarios, it automatically provisions VPC infrastructure including subnets across multiple zones, public gateways for internet access, and integrates Cloud Object Storage for the OpenShift internal registry."
